<p>Hello Anna,</p>
<p>A place has become free in a lesson at Studio Example that Mia Example is on the waiting list for:</p>
<p><strong>Imaginary Ballet</strong><br>Tuesday, 27 October 2026, 18:00–19:15<br>Room One, Studio Nowhere</p>
