<p><a href="https://school.example.org/waitlist/accept?token=abc123" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:6px;background-color:#18181b;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Take the place</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, open this link in your browser:<br><a href="https://school.example.org/waitlist/accept?token=abc123" style="color:#18181b;word-break:break-all;">https://school.example.org/waitlist/accept?token=abc123</a></p>
